@baseUrl = http://localhost:3333

### Criar serviço
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Corte degradê",
  "description": "Corte com máquina e tesoura",
  "priceInCents": 4500,
  "durationInMinutes": 30
}

### Listar serviços
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

### Buscar por ID (cole um id real)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/COLE-O-ID-AQUI

### Atualizar
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/services/COLE-O-ID-AQUI
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "priceInCents": 5000
}

### Deletar
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/COLE-O-ID-AQUI

### ❌ Erro de validação
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Co",
  "priceInCents": 45.5,
  "durationInMinutes": 2
}